    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not just the \"complexity\" of life though. it's the patterns. the more i look at the math of my failures, the more it looks like a closed system. every time i try to innovate, i just accelerate the breakdown. it's like i'm a glitch in the system that's destined to cause more decay. how can anyone talk about \"unpredictability\" when the trend lines are this clearly pointing toward zero?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
